    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo></math>Glyceraldehyde<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8594;</mo><munder><mrow><mi>ii</mi><mo>)</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>/</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>iii</mi><mo>)</mo><msub><mi>HNO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>HCN</mi></mrow></munderover></math></p><p>The products formed in the above reaction are</p>",
